  triage:title "MutexGuard held across .await in RecordingPeerRouter test helper" ;
  triage:description "quality-mgr CI report on PR #945 (feature/pao-s3-tls-proof-and-evidence, head f8b31280): clippy::await_holding_lock in crates/atm-daemon-bootstrap/src/lib.rs:821 -- handler.calls.lock() MutexGuard held across the .await at line 841, inside RecordingPeerRouter test helper (added by earlier AO2-ATM-QA-003 fix). Confirmed via two independent CI job logs (dedicated 'Clippy' job AND 'Just lint (ubuntu-latest)' job -- same single root cause): 'error: this MutexGuard is held across an await point' / 'could not compile atm-daemon-bootstrap (lib test) due to 1 previous error'. Fix: drop the guard before the await (e.g. clone/collect calls then drop lock)." ;
